config WLAN_VENDOR_SPRD
	bool "Spreadtrum wireless devices"
	default y
	help
	  Enable the configuration menu for Spreadtrum wireless devices.
	  Individual chip drivers are selected below and can be built as
	  modules. Disable this option if no Spreadtrum connectivity device
	  is present; unrelated wireless vendor drivers remain available.

if WLAN_VENDOR_SPRD

config SC2331
	tristate "Spreadtrum SC2331 connectivity support"
	depends on SERIAL_DEV_BUS && OF && MMC && CFG80211
	select CRC_ITU_T
	help
	  Boots the SC2331 connectivity controller through its UART ROM
	  protocol and loads its firmware using serdev and SDIO.
	  Requires factory-calibrated connectivity power, reset and reference
	clock providers. Supports station scanning; association and data
	traffic are not available yet.

endif
